{
 "description": "SysAdmin API v1 translations for the 28 v2 operations whose v1 route has a different method, path or body. Keyed by v2 operationId. Every entry was discovered against a live IRIS 2026.1 instance (request validator messages, never route names) and is verified by effect in FlightDeck.Test.V1Translations. Paths are relative to the v1 dispatcher's /v1 prefix, except /info, which the dispatcher serves directly. Body rules: none = no body (sent as {} for POST/PATCH); passthrough = the v2 body unchanged; action = {\"Action\": value}; actionFromBoolean = {\"Action\": ifTrue|ifFalse} chosen from a v2 boolean body field. Native: v2 operations with no v1 route that a v1-only native provider answers in the v2 shape (constitution 2.1.0, Principle I gaps). Withheld: operations with no v1 route that are deliberately left unavailable, with the reason appended to the version message.",
 "verifiedOn": "IRIS for UNIX (Ubuntu Server LTS for x86-64 Containers) 2026.1 (Build 234U)",
 "translations": {
  "GET /info": {
   "method": "GET",
   "path": "/info",
   "unversioned": true,
   "body": {
    "rule": "none"
   }
  },
  "GET /v2/wallet/collections": {
   "method": "GET",
   "path": "/wallet/",
   "body": {
    "rule": "none"
   }
  },
