 },
 "reasons": {
  "namespaceWrite": "FlightDeck reads namespaces on this version but does not change them: a native write would copy platform side effects FlightDeck does not control.",
  "journal": "FlightDeck does not read the journal natively: filtering records by the databases you can read is an authorization decision that belongs to IRIS.",
  "walletSecretWrite": "This IRIS version's wallet API asks for a different secret body than the one FlightDeck sends: it answers \"Field 'WalletSecretConfig.Secret' needs to be an object, not a literal type\", and then asks for AllowedHosts, RequireTLS and Usage, Usage itself as an object. FlightDeck does not guess a secret's shape. Use System Administration > Security > Wallet in the platform's management portal."
 }
